1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
5 words to never say in sales.

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:11,530
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say sign, instead say authorize - because people authorizing

3
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:15,070
feels like a choice, not a trap.

4
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:21,250
Don't say maybe, instead say absolutely - certainty closes, maybe kills.

5
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:27,910
Don't say cheap, instead say affordable - affordable feels smart, cheap feels risky.

6
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:34,690
Don't say customer, instead say client - clients feel like partners, customers feel

7
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,960
like numbers.

8
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:43,600
Don't say problem, instead say concern - concerns get solved, problems get blamed.

9
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:47,980
Your sales does not have to sound like everyone else's.

10
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:51,900
Comment 'SECRET' and I will send you the full list.

11
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:56,020
Make sure you follow - it only goes to followers.
